IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTPREFILL-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CHUNK-GRANULARITY   PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONCURRENT-PROMPTS  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTPREFILL-V2.
    IF TOTAL-TOKENS == 0 OR CHUNK-GRANULARITY == 0 OR CONCURRENT-PROMPTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 6100 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CONCURRENT-PROMPTS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
